            "speaker_id": 315682,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi team, let's kick off the new AV Demo Zone project. Our first step is to figure out the best location and which products to feature. I've started a draft layout guide in A4. Please add your thoughts on T1 (location) and T2 (product selection).",
