          {
            "msg_id": "M2",
            "speaker_id": 106421,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Great! I think the space near the main entrance, where the old speaker display was, would be perfect. It gets a lot of foot traffic. I can sketch something up for A4 this afternoon.",
