          {
            "msg_id": "M3",
            "speaker_id": 390795,
            "reply_to": "M2",
            "text": "That's a good spot for visibility, but we need to consider the noise bleed into the home appliance section next to it. Also, are there enough power outlets there? We should check the constraints in the project pack. Maybe the corner by the gaming section is better insulated for sound.",
