          {
            "msg_id": "M5",
            "speaker_id": 315682,
            "reply_to": "M4",
            "text": "Good thought on maximizing visibility, but that would block the main customer flow and could be a safety issue. Let's stick to the wall spaces. The point about sound is important, @390795. The gaming section corner is a strong contender. It has good power access and the acoustics would be more controlled.",
