        "thread_id": "TH3",
        "thread_goal": "Align on daily maintenance routine, responsibilities, and tracking approach.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M40",
            "speaker_id": 315682,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Alright team, let's sort out the daily operations. I've created a draft for the maintenance checklist in A3 (for T5) and the sales tracking sheet in A6 (for T10). Please take a look and share your feedback.",
