          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M49",
            "speaker_id": 315682,
            "reply_to": "M47",
            "text": "Perfect. I've updated A3 with the battery check. So we're decided: the daily maintenance checklist is final, and will be handled by the opening shift. The sales tracking sheet will be updated by the seller immediately following a demo-related sale.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
